local locationItems={[2319]=true,[2934]=true,[4234]=true,[4304]=true,[8169]=true,[8171]=true,[4235]=true,[783]=true,[5116]=true,[4232]=true,[8154]=true}

for key,a in pairs(areas) do P.GatherAreas[key]=a end
for key,a in pairs(nodes) do P.GatherNodeData.areas[key]=a end
for id,n in pairs(npcs) do P.NPCSources[id]=n end
for key,a in pairs(zones) do P.GatherZoneAreas[key]=a end
local function add(list,value) for _,v in ipairs(list) do if v==value then return end end;list[#list+1]=value end
for _,entries in pairs(P.GatherAtlas) do for _,e in ipairs(entries) do
    e.dropResearch=research[e.item] or e.dropResearch
    local patch=patches[e.item]
    if patch then
        local sources={}
        for _,s in ipairs(e.sources or {}) do if s.kind~='npc' or (s.method~='Loot' and s.method~='Open clam') then sources[#sources+1]=s end end
        for _,s in ipairs(patch.sources) do sources[#sources+1]=s end
        e.sources=sources;e.dropCoverage=patch.coverage;e.mapKeys=e.mapKeys or {};e.referenceURLs=e.referenceURLs or {}
        local words={e.searchText or e.name}
        for _,s in ipairs(sources) do
            words[#words+1]=s.name or '';words[#words+1]=table.concat(s.zones or {},' ')
            for _,key in ipairs(s.mapKeys or {}) do add(e.mapKeys,key) end
            if s.url then add(e.referenceURLs,s.url) end
        end
        add(e.referenceURLs,patch.coverage.url);e.searchText=table.concat(words,' '):lower()
        e.sub=(e.sub or 'Material'):gsub('%d+ sources',#sources..' sources')
        if e.note then e.note=e.note:gsub('Selected creature sources','Recorded creature sources') end
        local options={};local byMap={}
        for _,key in ipairs(choices[e.item]) do byMap[zones[key].mapId]=key end
        for _,key in ipairs(P.GatherZoneMaps[e.key] or {}) do
            local old=P.GatherZoneAreas[key]
            if old then add(options,byMap[old.mapId] or key) end
        end
        for _,key in ipairs(choices[e.item]) do add(options,key) end
        P.GatherZoneMaps[e.key]=options
    end
end end
for _,entries in pairs(P.GatherAtlas) do for _,e in ipairs(entries) do if locationItems[e.item] then
    e.mapKeys=e.mapKeys or {};local words={e.searchText or e.name}
    for _,s in ipairs(e.sources or {}) do
        local loc=s.kind=='npc' and locations[s.id]
        if loc then
            for _,field in ipairs({'zones','mapKeys','nodeKeys'}) do
                s[field]=s[field] or {};for _,value in ipairs(loc[field]) do add(s[field],value) end
            end
            for _,key in ipairs(s.mapKeys) do add(e.mapKeys,key) end
            words[#words+1]=table.concat(s.zones,' ')
        end
    end
    e.searchText=table.concat(words,' '):lower()
    local options,byMap={},{}
    for _,key in ipairs(choices[e.item]) do byMap[zones[key].mapId]=key end
    for _,key in ipairs(P.GatherZoneMaps[e.key] or {}) do
        local old=P.GatherZoneAreas[key];if old then add(options,byMap[old.mapId] or key) end
    end
    for _,key in ipairs(choices[e.item]) do add(options,key) end
    P.GatherZoneMaps[e.key]=options
end end end
